---
import { site } from '~/config/site';
interface Props {page:'about'|'privacy-policy'|'terms-of-service'|'copyright'|'contact';}
const {page}=Astro.props;
---
{page==='about'&&<>
 <p>{site.name} is an independent English-language resource for players of {site.game.name}, developed by {site.game.developer}. We cover getting started, co-op, combat systems, beast progression and official announcements.</p>
 <h2>How we work</h2><p>Our launch articles are researched from developer announcements and official store listings. We identify recommendations as editorial advice, distinguish Demo information from launch information, and do not claim hands-on testing where it has not happened.</p>
 <p>Every guide includes its sources and review date. See our <a href="/editorial-policy/">editorial policy</a> for evidence standards and corrections.</p>
 <h2>Independent ownership</h2><p>We are not Featherweight Games and do not represent the developer. Game screenshots and trademarks belong to their respective rights holders. The site is built using the MIT-licensed AnvilWiki template.</p>
 <h2>Corrections</h2><p>Use our <a href="/contact/">contact page</a> to report a mistake or raise a rights concern. Reading the site requires no account.</p>
</>}
{page==='contact'&&<>
 <p>For corrections, broken links or feedback about this independent website, <a href={site.contactUrl}>open an issue in our GitHub repository</a>. A GitHub account is required to post there. Do not include passwords, account details or other private information in a public issue.</p>
 <h2>Reporting a correction</h2><p>Include the page URL, the statement that needs changing, the game version or platform if relevant, and a source or screenshot supporting the correction.</p>
 <h2>Rights requests</h2><p>Identify the affected material, its URL, your relationship to the rights holder and the requested action. We will review substantiated requests and remove or replace material where appropriate.</p>
 <h2>Game support</h2><p>For purchases, multiplayer account problems or game bugs, use the <a href={site.social.official}>official game channels linked from Steam</a>. The game's support team does not operate this website.</p>
 {site.contactEmail&&<p>Email: <a href={`mailto:${site.contactEmail}`}>{site.contactEmail}</a></p>}
</>}
{page==='privacy-policy'&&<>
 <p>This page describes how {site.name} handles information. This is a static information site with no user accounts, public comments or on-site contact form.</p>
 <h2>Hosting and request information</h2><p>Cloudflare hosts and delivers the site. Requests expose information such as your IP address, requested URL and browser information to the hosting provider for delivery and security. See <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/">Cloudflare's privacy policy</a>.</p>
 <h2>Local preferences</h2><p>Your browser may store theme preferences, article feedback and a cookie-consent choice in local storage. You can clear these through your browser settings. Site search uses an index served by this website.</p>
 <h2>Advertising</h2><p>This site uses Adsterra banner and native advertising to help fund its operation. Advertising may involve cookies, IP addresses, device information and third-party requests. Optional advertising loads only after accepting the consent prompt. Declining leaves the guides available without those ad requests. You can reopen privacy choices from this page.</p>
 <p>See <a href="https://adsterra.com/privacy-policy/">Adsterra's privacy policy</a> for its practices. Advertising approval and availability do not affect our editorial conclusions. We do not sell user accounts or submitted personal information.</p>
 <h2>Analytics</h2><p>With your consent, Google Analytics 4 helps us understand page visits, reading engagement, outbound links and file downloads. Google may process browser and device information, identifiers, visited URLs and interaction events. Analytics cookies and requests load only after you accept the consent prompt. Declining prevents these optional requests. We do not enable Google Signals or advertising personalization. See <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">Google's privacy policy</a> for more information.</p>
 <h2>External links and media</h2><p>Official game screenshots are served locally. Following links to Steam, GitHub, console stores or other services exposes your request to those services under their policies. We do not currently embed video players.</p>
 <h2>Your choices and contact</h2><p>You can block optional cookies or scripts in your browser, clear local storage, or <a href="/contact/">contact the site operator</a> with a privacy question. Do not put personal information in a public GitHub issue.</p>
 <button type="button" class="btn-outline" id="reset-consent">Reset analytics and advertising consent choice</button><p id="consent-reset-result" role="status"></p>
 <h2>Updates</h2><p>We will revise this notice when the services used by the site change. The date at the top indicates the latest revision.</p>
</>}
{page==='terms-of-service'&&<>
 <p>This website provides independently researched game information and editorial advice. Use it for your own reference; verify version-sensitive details in the current game.</p>
 <h2>Accuracy and availability</h2><p>We aim to correct errors but do not guarantee completeness, game results or uninterrupted access. Updates may change a mechanic after a guide's review date. Announced future features may change before release.</p>
 <h2>Content and links</h2><p>Original prose belongs to its authors. Game assets remain the property of their rights holders. Linking to a page is welcome; do not imply an endorsement or republish third-party artwork under the code's MIT license.</p>
 <h2>Independent fan resource</h2><p>{site.legalNotice} Purchases, subscriptions and game support are handled by the relevant official services.</p>
 <h2>Questions</h2><p>Use the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a> to raise a site issue.</p>
</>}
{page==='copyright'&&<>
 <p>{site.game.name}, its characters, screenshots and trademarks belong to {site.game.developer} and the relevant rights holders. We claim no ownership of these game assets.</p>
 <h2>Media sources</h2><p>Our game imagery comes from the official Steam store's promotional screenshots and is used to illustrate editorial game coverage. Attribution does not imply a blanket license. Source records are maintained in the website repository.</p>
 <h2>Code and writing</h2><p>The AnvilWiki code foundation retains its MIT license and copyright notice. Third-party screenshots are excluded from that code license. Original article text is independently written for this site.</p>
 <h2>Removal requests</h2><p>Please use our <a href="/contact/">rights-request channel</a> to identify disputed material. We review requests and can remove or replace affected assets.</p>
</>}
<script>
document.getElementById('reset-consent')?.addEventListener('click',()=>{
 try {localStorage.removeItem('aw-cookie-consent-v2');location.reload();} catch {const result=document.getElementById('consent-reset-result');if(result)result.textContent='Please clear site storage in your browser settings.';}
});
</script>
